---
source: crates/runtime/tests/search/mod.rs
description: "SELECT id, answer, question, subject, trunc(_score, 3) as _score FROM vector_search(qs, 'second', answer) order by _score desc, id LIMIT 4"
---
+---------------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
+---------------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Projection: vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer).id, CAST(vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer).answer AS LargeUtf8) AS answer, CAST(vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer).question AS LargeUtf8) AS question, vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer).subject, _score                                                                                                                                               |
|               |   Sort: _score DESC NULLS FIRST, vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer).id ASC NULLS LAST, fetch=4                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |     Projection: vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer).id, vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer).answer, vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer).question, vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer).subject, trunc(vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer)._score, Int64(3)) AS _score                                                                                                                                  |
|               |       TableScan: vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer) projection=[_score, answer, id, question, subject]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
| physical_plan | ProjectionExec: expr=[id@0 as id, CAST(answer@1 AS LargeUtf8) as answer, CAST(question@2 AS LargeUtf8) as question, subject@3 as subject, _score@4 as _score]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |   RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(3), input_partitions=1, maintains_sort_order=true                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |     SortExec: TopK(fetch=4), expr=[_score@4 DESC, id@0 ASC NULLS LAST], preserve_partitioning=[false]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |       CoalescePartitionsExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |         ProjectionExec: expr=[id@0 as id, CAST(answer@3 AS LargeUtf8) as answer, CAST(question@4 AS LargeUtf8) as question, subject@1 as subject, trunc(_score@2, 3) as _score]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |           HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=Left, accumulator=MinMaxLeftAccumulator, on=[(id@0, id@1)], projection=[id@0, subject@1, _score@2, answer@3, question@5]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |             CoalescePartitionsExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |               ProjectionExec: expr=[CAST(key@1 AS Int64) as id, subject@0 as subject, 1 - distance@2 as _score]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |                 BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |                   RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(3), input_partitions=1                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |                     S3VectorsQueryExec (INDEX_NAME_1): limit=100                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |             SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |               CayenneAccelerationExec: snapshots_scanned=1, files_scanned=1                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |                 BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |                   RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(3), input_partitions=1                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |                     DataSourceExec: file_groups={1 group: [[<NORMALIZED_PATH>/.vortex]]}, projection=[answer, id, question], file_type=vortex, predicate: DynamicFilter [ empty ] AND DynamicFilter [ empty ] |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
+---------------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
